# ◈ /etc/portage/package.accept_keywords/athanor-binpkgs
#
# Several upstream packages track ~arch (testing) rather than stable —
# check packages.kde-qt.list and packages.xlibre.list before assuming
# everything is stable-keyworded.
#
# Example, matching what upstream CI itself accepts for the kde-qt group:
# dev-qt/qtbase ~amd64
# kde-frameworks/* ~amd64
#
# The xlibre group needs the whole overlay accepted:
# */*::xlibre ~amd64
